WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BOOT, POINT and PAYLOAD_ON are acknowledged by the actual C++ model.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
A power fault triggers SAFE. Onboard protection disables the payload.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Recovery is rejected: the health gates are not yet satisfied.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Clear the fault, then advance 40 simulated minutes to recharge.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
All health gates pass. RECOVER and RESUME return the model to NOMINAL.
